OL,3,CMan and woman die after being pulled
OL,4,Cfrom sea
OL,6,FTwo people have died after being
OL,7,Fpulled from the sea at a Cornish beach.
OL,9,FEmergency services were called to
OL,10,FFistral Beach in Newquay at around
OL,11,F9:45pm on Sunday 26 July following
OL,12,Freports that two people had been
OL,13,Frecovered from the water.
OL,15,FA cordon was put in place, which has
OL,16,Fsince been removed.
OL,18,FThe man and woman died at the scene.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/2
