OL,3,CMan and woman die after being pulled
OL,4,Cfrom sea
OL,6,FIn a statement, Devon and Cornwall
OL,7,FPolice said: "Their families have been
OL,8,Finformed, and our thoughts are with
OL,9,Fthem at this extremely difficult time.
OL,11,F"A file will be prepared for HM
OL,12,FCoroner."
